          "kicker": "Coaching backing",
          "heading": "RFU's Bill Sweeney gives Steve Borthwick unequivocal backing before Australia test",
          "body": "This week RFU chief executive Bill Sweeney gave Steve Borthwick his unequivocal backing to lead England at the 2027 World Cup. It follows the union's decision two months ago to extend the head coach's contract until after the 2028 Six Nations, even though England lost four of five matches in a single championship for the first time. Sweeney said: \"We're committed to Steve. We believe in what he's doing.\" England have lost five of their last seven Tests, and Sweeney added that the union wants \"continued progress\"."
