          "heading": "France v Fiji streams free on TF1+, ITVX and RugbyPass TV",
          "body": "Les Bleus' Saturday meeting with Fiji in Lyon can be watched without a subscription in four markets. In France it is on TF1+ and broadcast channel TF1; in the UK, ITV1 and ITVX both carry it, though viewers need a current TV Licence to watch live television. Ireland gets it on Virgin Media Play and Virgin Media One, and in the United States it is on World Rugby's RugbyPass TV, which requires registration before streaming."
