      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury update",
          "heading": "Robert Baloucoune goes off with knock as Mack Hansen has ankle concern",
          "body": "Robert Baloucoune departed in the 58th minute of Friday's 42-12 win over Argentina, one of several knocks picked up in Dublin. Mack Hansen continued after treatment but has an ankle concern, as does Josh van der Flier, while Sean Jansen sustained a \"bang\" to his knee. The knocks are particularly concerning for Andy Farrell's back three, who had played together only once before and produced Hugo Keenan's first try after Baloucoune found Hansen in space. Keenan, Hansen and Baloucoune have all struggled with injuries in the past year."
        },
