          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Pumas captain Julián Montoya fails head injury assessment in Dublin loss",
          "body": "Julián Montoya went off for a head injury assessment 28 minutes into the Dublin defeat and never returned, with BBC Sport reporting that the Pumas captain failed the HIA before half-time. Leonel Oviedo also went through an HIA, returning to the field after about four minutes, and the Americas Rugby News report describes the forwards as repeatedly disrupted. Argentina travel to Italy and France next, after a third defeat in four games."
