          "body": "Scotland hooker Ewan Ashman scored three first-half tries at Murrayfield, but New Zealand controlled the second half, when Scotland failed to score at all. Beauden Barrett scored two of the visitors' seven tries, Josh Moorby and Asafo Aumua added others, and Planet Rugby reports Ashman became the first Scotsman to score a hat-trick against the All Blacks. Wallace Sititi scored early but was yellow-carded in the first half."
